abstract: ST-FCL predicts grid-level urban inflow and outflow by fusing temporal and spatial views, learned through contrastive
  pretraining, with an external-factor view. On the full TaxiBJ dataset it reaches RMSE 14.71, against 15.41 for the best
  baseline, ATFM.
